# Pending 註冊流程 — 完整走查

## 最終運作流程

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 使用者
    participant RPi as RPi Web UI
    participant BG as Background Thread<br/>(純網路 I/O)
    participant Q as 共享佇列<br/>(mutex)
    participant TDL as TDL Thread<br/>(VPSS/TPU Owner)

    User->>RPi: 上傳照片 + 姓名
    RPi->>RPi: 存入 SQLite (status=pending)

    BG->>RPi: GET /api/pending
    RPi-->>BG: [{id:18, name:"a", photo_path:"..."}]
    BG->>RPi: GET /uploads/{photo}
    RPi-->>BG: JPEG binary (100KB)
    BG->>Q: push PendingTask

    TDL->>Q: pop PendingTask
    Note over TDL: imgprocess_t → ReadImage(RGB_888_PLANAR)
    Note over TDL: UnBind VI → FaceDetection → ReBind VI
    Note over TDL: extractFeature → BioHash → template_hex
    TDL->>Q: push CompletedTask

    BG->>Q: pop CompletedTask
    BG->>RPi: POST /api/persons/18/complete
    RPi->>RPi: status=completed ✅
```

